   "npc": "252475",
   "questID": 92840,
   "race": "High Order Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "It's often difficult for me to establish a distinction between the Windshapers and the Al'Aketh, save that one is more overtly violent than the other. Equally slavish to their misplaced beliefs, they are both equally dangerous if left to their own devices.\r\n\r\nThey see our desire to better understand this realm and its magic as a desecration of their traditions. Their small-mindedness is why our mission is so important. If not us, who will have the courage to save Zephras?",
   "time": 1791564624,
   "title": "Catching Wind",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Zephras Isle"
  },
